{"id":"dbe-directory-and-city","title":"State-certified disadvantaged businesses in five Bay Area counties, set against the City's files","question":"Which firms in the State's directory of certified disadvantaged businesses does the City pay or put on contract teams, are they also City-certified local firms, and do any share an address or telephone?","finding":"The directory export lists 210 firms (228 certifications: 200 DBE, 26 ACDBE) in Alameda 93, San Francisco 71, Contra Costa 30, San Mateo 13, Marin 3; Caltrans certified 65, BART certified 62, SFMTA certified 52, SFO certified 15. By name, 43 were paid by the City since fiscal 2019 ($148.6 million), 68 appear on City contract teams and 54 are also in the City's local-business directory; the largest City payee is R&S Construction Management Inc. ($45.8 million, mostly Public Works). 10 certified firms share a telephone, street address or company email domain with another certified firm.","how":"One row per certification in the export (cp1252 text, header and footer lines dropped); firms are de-duplicated on the directory's certification number. Names (and any dba) are matched to the Controller's payment and contract files and to the City Partner local-business directory on the project's normalised name key. Identifiers are compared exactly; a free-mail domain is not used and a value shared by more than four firms (a business centre) is ignored.","limits":"The directory is today's list: a firm decertified before November 2026 is not in it, so it cannot test past contracts. The City files carry no disadvantaged-business flag, so whether a prime claimed a firm toward a federal goal cannot be checked here; that needs the department's goal reports. The federal size and personal-net-worth limits are not in any file on disk, so City payments are shown without a judgment about size. Owners' names, race and sex printed in the directory are not used. A shared telephone or address can be a family firm, a shared office or a bookkeeper.","tier":"REDFLAG","columns":[{"k":"firm","t":"Certified firm","type":"org"},{"k":"county","t":"County","type":"text"},{"k":"cert","t":"Certification","type":"text"},{"k":"agency","t":"Certified through","type":"text"},{"k":"paid","t":"City paid since fiscal 2019","type":"usd"},{"k":"dept","t":"Main paying department","type":"text"},{"k":"yearsPaid","t":"Fiscal years paid","type":"text"},{"k":"teams","t":"City contract teams","type":"int"},{"k":"teamRoles","t":"Roles","type":"text"},{"k":"cityFlag","t":"City local-business flag on teams","type":"text"},{"k":"inLBE","t":"In City LBE directory","type":"text"},{"k":"shared","t":"Shared identifiers","type":"text"}],"rows":[{"firmKey":"","firm":"R&S Construction Management Inc.","county":"San Francisco","cert":"DBE","agency":"Caltrans","paid":45792593,"dept":"Public Works","yearsPaid":"2019-2027","teams":117,"teamRoles":"Prime Contractor, Subcontractor","cityFlag":"LBE, Non-LBE","inLBE":"yes","shared":null},{"firmKey":"","firm":"Hollins Consulting, Inc.","county":"San Francisco","cert":"DBE","agency":"BART","paid":18430236,"dept":"Airport Commission","yearsPaid":"2019-2027","teams":60,"teamRoles":"Joint Venture Constituent, Prime Contractor, Subcontractor","cityFlag":"LBE, Non-LBE","inLBE":"yes","shared":null},{"firmKey":"","firm":"Applied Technology & Science, A-T-S","county":"San Francisco","cert":"DBE","agency":"SFMTA","paid":13841447,"dept":"Public Utilities Commsn","yearsPaid":"2020-2027","teams":44,"teamRoles":"Joint Venture Constituent, Prime Contractor, Subcontractor","cityFlag":"LBE, Non-LBE","inLBE":"yes","shared":null},{"firmKey":"","firm":"MARINSHIP DEVELOPMENT INTEREST LLC","county":"Alameda","cert":"DBE","agency":"SFMTA","paid":10891159,"dept":"Public Utilities Commsn","yearsPaid":"2021-2027","teams":8,"teamRoles":"Prime Contractor, Subcontractor","cityFlag":"LBE, Non-LBE","inLBE":"yes; restricted affiliates: AM HELIOS INC, Marinship Consulting Services, Inc","shared":null},{"firmKey":"","firm